  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\operatorname{Lim}_{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{\\frac{d}{d x} \\int_0^{x^2} \\sec ^2 t d t}{\\frac{d}{d x}(x \\sin x)}=\\operatorname{Lim}_{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{\\sec ^2 x^2 \\cdot 2 x}{\\sin x+x \\cos x}$\n(by L'Hospital rule)\n$\\operatorname{Lim}_{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{2 \\sec ^2 x^2}{\\left(\\frac{\\sin x}{x}+\\cos x\\right)}=\\frac{2 \\times 1}{1+1}=1$",
    "image": null
